                <h2 class="h4 text-secondary mb-0 fw-bold">Experience</h2>
              </div>
              
              <div class="accordion" id="experienceAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-item cv-accordion-item mb-3">
                  <h3 class="accordion-header" id="expHeadingOne">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#expCollapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="expCollapseOne">
                      <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between w-100 pe-3">
                        <span class="fw-bold">Developer, School Manager Platform</span>
                        <span class="small text-muted fw-normal">Academic Project | 2023</span>
                      </div>
                    </button>
                  </h3>
                  <div id="expCollapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="expHeadingOne" data-bs-parent="#experienceAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                      <p class="mb-2"><em>Implemented a centralized system for managing academic records and faculty assignments.</em></p>
                      <ul class="list-unstyled mt-3">
                        <li class="mb-2 d-flex"><i class="bi bi-check2-square text-primary me-2 mt-1"></i> <span><strong>Database Design:</strong> Implemented a schema to handle complex relationships between students, faculty, and courses.</span></li>
                        <li class="mb-2 d-flex"><i class="bi bi-check2-square text-primary me-2 mt-1"></i> <span><strong>Logic Layer:</strong> Integrated business logic for automated enrollment verification processes.</span></li>
                        <li class="mb-2 d-flex"><i class="bi bi-check2-square text-primary me-2 mt-1"></i> <span><strong>Interface:</strong> Built a responsive UI using Bootstrap 5 for ease of data entry and monitoring.</span></li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="mb-5">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3 border-bottom pb-2">
                <i class="bi bi-code-square fs-3 text-primary me-2"></i>
                <h2 class="h4 text-secondary mb-0 fw-bold">Notable Projects</h2>
              </div>
              
              <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                  <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100 bg-light">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-joystick me-2 text-primary"></i>Embedded Logic Controller</h5>
                    <p class="small text-muted mb-2">C++ & Arduino</p>
                    <p class="small">Developed a logic-based control system for automation prototypes, focusing on memory efficiency and low-latency response times within hardware constraints.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                  <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100 bg-light">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-server me-2 text-primary"></i>REST API Service</h5>
                    <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Ruby on Rails</p>
                    <p class="small">Created a lightweight API for resource management, featuring JWT authentication and structured JSON responses for mobile application integration.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="mb-4">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3 border-bottom pb-2">
                <i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill fs-3 text-primary me-2"></i>
                <h2 class="h4 text-secondary mb-0 fw-bold">Education</h2>
              </div>
              
              <div class="list-group list-group-flush">
                <div class="list-group-item px-0 border-0">
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
                    <div>
                      <h5 class="mb-1 fw-bold">B.S. Computer Engineering</h5>
                      <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Ateneo de Naga University</p>
                      <small class="text-primary">3rd Honors • Expected Graduation 2027</small>
                    </div>
                    <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">2023 - Present</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="list-group-item px-0 border-0 mt-3">
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
                    <div>
                      <h5 class="mb-1 fw-bold">Senior High School - STEM</h5>
                      <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Ateneo de Naga University</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">2021 - 2023</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>
            
            <section>
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3 border-bottom pb-2">
                <i class="bi bi-award-fill fs-3 text-primary me-2"></i>
                <h2 class="h4 text-secondary mb-0 fw-bold">Certifications</h2>
              </div>
              <ul class="list-inline">
                <li class="list-inline-item"><span class="badge border border-primary text-primary bg-white p-2"><i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill me-1"></i> Ruby on Rails Specialization</span></li>
                <li class="list-inline-item"><span class="badge border border-primary text-primary bg-white p-2"><i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill me-1"></i> Responsive Web Design</span></li>
                <li class="list-inline-item"><span class="badge border border-primary text-primary bg-white p-2"><i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill me-1"></i> Git Version Control</span></li>
              </ul>
            </section>

          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center text-white-50 mt-4 pb-5">
          <small>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> Matt Rayner P. Santiago. Built with Rails & Bootstrap 5.</small>
          <br>
          <small>NOT REAL INFORMATION</small>
